5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The morning congestion is unacceptable. We need data on actual usage patterns to justify allocation.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Before discussing space, we must understand the financial implications. Who is paying for the current setup?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I am concerned about perceived fairness. Have the same residents always claimed the same spots?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let’s not create a system that turns neighbors into rivals. I want to see the history of conflicts.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about the long-term maintenance burden. Who actually keeps the racks clean and functional?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, financials are secondary. The physical bottleneck is the primary issue.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, ignoring costs leads to future disputes. I need to see the ledger.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I will check the minutes to see if past complaints were resolved or ignored.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I’ll look at the complaint log. If we ignore past friction, it will resurface.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,I need to know the physical effort involved. I’ll check the rain exposure and frame trial.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. Data over opinion. I will observe the morning departures and check the sticker register.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will review the building account ledger and the treasurer’s handover file.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will examine the five years of association minutes and the last year’s complaint log.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look into the last year’s complaint log and the account from the neighbouring block.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will investigate the trial of the supplier's display frame and the rain exposure along the parking rows.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
